    "objetivo": "Give commands to a friend, to several people, to yourself and your friends together («noi»), and to a stranger with «Lei». Avoid the English-speaker traps: using the dictionary form as a command, saying «non scrivi» for «don't write», and mixing «tu» and «Lei» in one sentence.",
